Cell["\<\
This GB reduces all functions GeneralGB1. Similarly, the GeneralGB1 reduces \
all functions in PolysGB. We conclude the ideals are the same.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  4.0022792780889816`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"af394cbc-24ad-4e65-b266-\
1d8d76fd7110"],

