Cell["\<\
The c1^2 =1 subcases are similar to the above and are included for \
completeness. We first consider c1 = 1. \
\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.002277383501449*^9, 4.002277428508052*^9}, {
  4.002277574817234*^9, 
